DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The bbccmmssttbbrreessccaall driver supports the reset calibration controller for the
     integrated PCIe/SATA components of Broadcom Set-top Box SoCs.  This in‐
     cludes the Broadcom BCM2712 SoC that is used in the Raspberry Pi 5.  It
     does not provide direct device driver entry points but makes its func‐
     tions available to other drivers.

